    "username": "godofprompt",
    "nickname": "God of Prompt",
    "text": "Cursor's notice, with the full indicator list and scripts:\nhttps://cursor.com/blog/claude-code-extension-security-notice\n\nthe prompt that turns it into a bulletin for your team:\nhttps://godofprompt.ai/prompt-library/craft-security-bulletins",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
